---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'October 12, 2026';
const contactLine = site.contactEmail
  ? `email us at <a href="mailto:${site.contactEmail}">${site.contactEmail}</a> or use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>`
  : 'use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Northline Digital collects, uses, and protects the information you share through this website."
>
  <section class="pt-16 pb-24 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-32" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <header class="lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow text-gold-ink">Legal</p>
        <h1 id="page-title" class="mt-6 text-5xl leading-[1.05] font-medium sm:text-6xl">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-ink">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="policy max-w-none text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-ink lg:col-span-8 [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-navy [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-2 [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:mb-4 [&_h2]:text-3xl [&_h2]:font-medium [&_h2]:text-navy [&_li]:mt-2 [&_p]:mt-4 [&_ul]:mt-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6">
        <p class="mt-0!">
          This policy explains how Northline Digital (“we”, “us”) handles information collected through this website. We
          aim to collect as little as possible and to use it only to respond to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit our contact or website audit request form, we collect the information you provide:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name and email address</li>
          <li>Your business name and, optionally, your existing website address</li>
          <li>The service you’re interested in, your project description, and, optionally, a budget range</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To protect the form from spam and abuse, our server also processes your IP address when you submit it. We use
          a one-way hashed version of it to limit repeated submissions; that record expires automatically, usually
          within about 20 minutes.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To review your request, prepare your website audit, and reply to you</li>
          <li>To discuss, scope, and provide services you ask us about</li>
          <li>To protect this website and its form from spam and abuse</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to marketing lists. We will only contact you about your
          inquiry unless you ask us otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies and does not track you across other websites. If a
          spam-protection check is shown on our contact form, it is provided by Cloudflare Turnstile, which may process
          limited technical information to tell people and automated programs apart.
        </p>

        <h2>Service providers</h2>
        <p>We rely on a small number of trusted providers to run this website:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and processes requests to it, including standard security
            logs.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>A transactional email provider</strong> delivers form submissions to our inbox. Your submission
            passes through their systems to reach us.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>These providers process information on our behalf and only as needed to provide their services.</p>

        <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiries are kept in our business email for as long as needed to respond and, if we work together, to manage
          the project and meet our record-keeping obligations. If a submission ever fails to reach our inbox because of
          a technical problem, a copy may be held securely for up to 30 days so we can still respond, then deleted. You
          can ask us to delete your information at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
          This website is served over an encrypted (HTTPS) connection, and access to submitted information is limited to
          the people who need it to respond to you. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we
          take reasonable steps to protect your information.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Depending on
          where you live, you may have additional rights under local privacy law. To make a request,{' '}
          <Fragment set:html={contactLine} />.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>This website is intended for businesses and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If we change how we handle information, we will update this page and the “Last updated” date above.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Please <Fragment set:html={contactLine} />.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
